:name: BlackPill F411 line coverage (retracer)
:description: cov_demo.elf on the BlackPill model; tracing is started by the Robot test (one trace per test case).
$elf?=$ex_out/cov_demo.elf

using sysbus
mach create "cov"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ex_dir/../stm32f4_blackpill/blackpill_f411.repl
showAnalyzer usart1
sysbus LoadELF $elf
